      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        69,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/69/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:03e95055721624f4d8234100",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她的使命在不知不觉间，已经成为了束缚她的枷\r\n锁。既然如此，那便将她的使命变得更为崇高。\r\n至少，也要让她自那枷锁中获得一瞬的喘息……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0a0fb29596dee41a56edeeab15b1d79053e64d8f11b78dab3919cda30d670243",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1022/storytimeline_501022108.json",
      "json_path": [
