      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "『……我打心底里尊敬着殿下，\r\n故此才奉她为主，并随她一同来到这里。\r\n不过……』",
      "source_fingerprint": "b01985e03c1add973b5820e762537212a7d82044b48d0dc9021c160caed1e846",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
