      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这是参加闪耀・系列赛的赛马娘们，\r\n永远都在追求的目标：\r\n给粉丝们留下能称颂一生的回忆……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "becbe922a0921df5ded9e5997473cc4a294adffd077da5448d69d5de97af70ee",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
